MCSKIP MT,<>
MCINS %.
A structure may offer alternatives, and the count of arguments
says which one was taken.
MCDEF MEASURE OPT METRES . OR YARDS FEET INCHES ALL ; AS <args=%T1. [%A1.]>
MEASURE 5 METRES 20 . 3 ;
MEASURE 2 YARDS 1 FEET 4 INCHES 6 ;
A delimiter may be its own successor, which gives a list of any length.
MCDEF SUM N1 OPT + N1 OR ; ALL AS <count=%T1. first=[%A1.]>
SUM 1 + 2 + 3 + 4 ;
SUM 9 ;
